        "verse": 51
      },
      {
        "text": "And the Lord spake unto Moses, saying,",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 52,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 26:52",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 26,
        "verse": 52
      },
      {
        "text": "Unto these the land shall be divided for an inheritance according to the number of names.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 53,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Numbers 26:53",
        "book": "Numbers",
        "chapter": 26,
        "verse": 53
      },
      {
        "text": "To many thou shalt give the more inheritance, and to few thou shalt give the less inheritance: to every one shall his inheritance be given according to those that were numbered of him.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 3,
            "end": 7,
            "text": "IE a large tribe (also v. 56)."
          },
          {
            "start": 53,
            "end": 56,
