        "chapter": 26,
        "verse": 62
      },
      {
        "text": "These are they that were numbered by Moses and Eleazar the priest, who numbered the children of Israel in the plains of Moab by Jordan near Jericho.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 6,
            "end": 9
